  "_doc": "Technique effect rows (Combat Laws Bible §11, §7, §12; DECISIONS 'Effect table'). Every `effect` id a technique in data/techs names is either a bespoke handler in scripts/combat/tech_effects.gd (TechEffects.HANDLED), a row under `techs` (run by EffectSteps), or listed under `flavour` or `pending` with its reason; every enemy action `effect` is an arm of EnemyEffects (scripts/combat/enemy_effects.gd) or listed under `enemy_pending`; every status id the data names (enemy action `status`, technique `lv2_debuff`, a row's status op) has a reader in scripts/ (a has/stacks/data query, StatusComponent.PERIODS or MAX_STACKS) or is listed under `status_pending`. lint_data.py and tests/suite_effects.gd fail on anything else. A row: `chapter` (when the kit first reaches it), `requires` (availability), `resolve` (damage | support | none; default from the technique), `pre` (action changes), `mult` / `per_debuff` (damage), `shave` (flat shave bonus), `no_shave`, `after` (ops after the hit), `unbuilt` (clauses that wait for a system). The op and condition vocabulary is EffectTable.OPS / EffectTable.CONDITIONS.",
